        sums. Särkisuo 2022 is 5 % below the provider.
      </p>
      <p>
        At Qvidja, our GPP and Reco are 15 to 31 % below the provider. The provider used a daytime method. Its night Reco
        is about 55 % above the measured night NEE. Our method follows the measured night flux. We report this
        difference and do not correct it.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our Qvidja NEE sums are more negative than Heimsch et al. 2024, because the current file has a later processing
