      <pre><code>npm run build:db     # db/*.parquet from the source files
npm run calc         # data/calculated/* (GPP, Reco, sums, NECB, validation)
npm run site:build   # copies the tables to the site and builds this page</code></pre>
      <p>
        The parameters are in <code>scripts/lib/calc/constants.ts</code>. This run used the options <code>--ustar {report.options.ustar}</code>, <code>--temp {report.options.temp}</code> and{' '}
        <code>--gpp-night {report.options.gppNight}</code>.
      </p>
    </section>

